{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52926","headline":"诗 二 · 寒山","name":"诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"井底生红尘，高峰起波（《五灯会元》作「白」）浪。\n石女生石儿，龟毛寸寸长。\n若要学菩提，但看此牓（《五灯会元》作「模」）样。\n（《天圣广灯录》卷二十三、《五灯会元》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}